<title>USA: Anheuser-Busch sets $250 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Anheuser-Busch sets $250 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Dillion Read &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER ANHEUSER-BUSCH COS INC</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 11/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.467  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 6.824 PCT   PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS  SPREAD 55 BP	CALLABLE AFTER SEVEN</p>
<p>							YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
